WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.300
The date is September 15th, 1979.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.200
Before I met you, my life
was so ordinary.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.000
Okay, so...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.000
I have a confession to make.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Hey Dan.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.000
It's dad.

